    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_05",
      "hash64": "474976A54A1217C4",
      "text": "……他和我有一點交情。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_21",
      "hash64": "171C836E92DA5A86",
      "text": "[EMPTY 85]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0055"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_06",
      "hash64": "474979A54A121CDD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 85]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0055"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "9D4A6DAA47F5949D",
      "text": "叫我聶凱吧。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_22",
      "hash64": "171C826E92DA58D3",
      "text": "哦……你的目的是什麼？[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "9D4A6AAA47F58F84",
      "text": "服裝企業的公子……\\n你有這麼雄厚的背景，為什麼加入天星隊？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_23",
      "hash64": "171C816E92DA5720",
      "text": "一上門就丟問題過來，真沒禮貌。\\n那當然是和其他的隊員一樣啊。\\r\\n因為我也一直被霸凌……[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "9D4A6BAA47F59137",
      "text": "過去學院裡果然有霸凌的問題啊……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_24",
      "hash64": "171C886E92DA6305",
      "text": "你不知道也很正常。\\n畢竟現在學校裡是多麼的和平。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_25",
      "hash64": "171C876E92DA6152",
      "text": "而且那些會霸凌的學生\\n都已經不在學校了。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "9D4A68AA47F58C1E",
      "text": "……那是怎麼回事？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_07",
      "hash64": "474978A54A121B2A",
      "text": "……關於這一點，\\n就由我這個前任校長來說明吧。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_26",
      "hash64": "171C866E92DA5F9F",
      "text": "……管家。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_08",
      "hash64": "47496BA54A120513",
      "text": "大概在１年半以前，\\n天星隊和霸凌他們的學生之間\\r\\n發生了一場騷動。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_09",
      "hash64": "47496AA54A120360",
      "text": "雖然事情沒有鬧到不可收拾，\\n但也是個前所未有的事件。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_10",
      "hash64": "4745EDA54A0EF922",
      "text": "由於這個事件，\\n身為霸凌加害者的學生們\\r\\n都離開了學院。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "9D4A69AA47F58DD1",
      "text": "可是學院裡沒有那樣的紀錄……！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_11",
      "hash64": "4745EEA54A0EFAD5",
      "text": "想必是沒有的……\\n因為紀錄被當時候的\\r\\n訓導主任給清除掉了……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "9D4A66AA47F588B8",
      "text": "清除掉了紀錄！？\\n天啊，居然會發生這種事……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_12",
      "hash64": "4745EBA54A0EF5BC",
      "text": "當我煩惱該如何處置天星隊的時候，\\n有個學生出現在我的面前。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_13",
      "hash64": "4745ECA54A0EF76F",
      "text": "那個學生說，\\n自己會為天星隊負起所有責任。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_14",
      "hash64": "4745E9A54A0EF256",
      "text": "作為交換條件，\\n那個學生請求我免除對夥伴們的處分。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_27",
      "hash64": "171C856E92DA5DEC",
      "text": "欸！？這件事……！\\n我從來都沒聽說過……！！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_15",
      "hash64": "4745EAA54A0EF409",
      "text": "我接受了那名學生的請求，\\n打消了處分天星隊的念頭。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_16",
      "hash64": "4745E7A54A0EEEF0",
      "text": "然後，我要求那名學生\\n去留學１年半的時間。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "9D4A67AA47F58A6B",
      "text": "１年半……？留學……？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_17",
      "hash64": "4745E8A54A0EF0A3",
      "text": "……留學是為了取代處分。\\n天星隊是霸凌的受害者。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_18",
      "hash64": "4745F5A54A0F06BA",
      "text": "我希望那名學生的心靈可以獲得休息。\\n因此以留學的名目，\\r\\n讓那名學生回到家鄉伽勒爾地區。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_19",
      "hash64": "4745F6A54A0F086D",
      "text": "就在那時，\\n當時候的訓導主任為了逃避責任，\\c\\n他把所有和這個事件有關的紀錄\\n通通都從伺服器上給刪除掉了……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "9D4A64AA47F58552",
      "text": "豈有此理！\\n這個事件居然被隱蔽掉了……！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_20",
      "hash64": "474267A54A0BDF99",
      "text": "當然，我也對訓導主任做出了應有的處分。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_21",
      "hash64": "474266A54A0BDDE6",
      "text": "只是，沒能夠阻止這個\\n行為的我和其他的老師們，\\r\\n都該背負相同的責任……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_24",
      "hash64": "47426BA54A0BE665",
      "text": "於是為了承擔責任，\\n我辭去了校長的職位。\\c\\n並且請當時的所有老師們\\n也跟著我一起辭職了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "9D4A65AA47F58705",
      "text": "所以１年半以前，\\n老師們才會變成全新的陣容啊……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_22",
      "hash64": "474265A54A0BDC33",
      "text": "我給大家添麻煩了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_28",
      "hash64": "171C8C6E92DA69D1",
      "text": "我說管家啊，\\n你為什麼現在才要說那些事？[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_jentle_23",
      "hash64": "474264A54A0BDA80",
      "text": "……不論是少爺或天星隊，\\n都不能繼續這樣下去了。\\r\\n如果這能成為一個契機……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_29",
      "hash64": "171C8B6E92DA681E",
      "text": "事到如今要我背叛夥伴，\\n自己一個人去學校我可無法想像。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "9D4DD2AA47F87613",
      "text": "看來你真的很重視天星隊的大家。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_30",
      "hash64": "1718FE6E92D742B0",
      "text": "那還用說。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_040_fairyboss_31",
      "hash64": "1718FF6E92D74463",
      "text": "畢竟他們……都是我的寶物。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
